{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1787774727,"nonce":"EtkqppPX+bWHkXVbhpG1MNbJ5LE=","title":"feat(web-ui): fixture/demo mode for serverless UI dev","message":"\u003e Imported from pull request #54 (MERGED)\n\u003e Branch: `docs/screenshots-acme` → `main`\n\u003e Created: 2026-07-22T05:24:23Z · Merged: 2026-07-22T12:55:23Z\n\n\nAdds a flag-gated **fixture mode** to `scarab-web-ui`. With `VITE_SCARAB_MOCK=1`, the app patches `window.fetch` + `EventSource` to serve a fixed **acme** org — dashboard, run-detail, environments, secrets — so the UI renders with **no server, DB, or `SCARAB_API_URL`**.\n\nThe fastest way to eyeball a UI change, and the source of record for the docs screenshots (which is why it uses a neutral identity — `org=acme`, `author=a.kim` — so nothing real leaks into published shots).\n\n\n```bash\njust ui-mock            # or: npm --prefix ui/scarab-web-ui run dev:mock\n```\n\nThen open the dashboard, `/acme/scarab/runs/0190f8a2000071fb8c0011223344aabb` for run-detail, etc. Append `?theme=dark` (or `?theme=light`) to pin the theme; otherwise the normal toggle applies.\n\n\n- **Off by default, out of prod.** `index.tsx` only *dynamically* imports `src/mock.ts` when the flag is set. Verified: a production `vite build` (no flag) does **not** include the fixture in the bundle.\n- `vite.config.ts` skips the `SCARAB_API_URL` dev-server guard under the flag (no proxy target needed).\n- `src/vite-env.d.ts` adds minimal typing for the one env var (the project uses `types: []`, so no `vite/client`).\n- Interception covers both the `openapi-fetch` client and the hand-rolled raw `fetch()`/`EventSource` log streams; edit fixtures in `src/mock.ts` to check other UI states.\n\n\nRe-captured **acme** docs screenshots (dashboard/run-detail/environments/secrets, dark) will land as a separate commit once captured via the browser, replacing the current org-branded images in `ui/scarab-docs-ui/src/assets/` and `docs/assets/screenshots/`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":null}]}